#   ha        Home Assistant tts.speak / assist_satellite announce. Speaks on
#             the Pine Box. Produces no audio file.
#   piper     Wyoming Piper directly (tcp 10200) -> a WAV at /media/<key>.
#   ha_file   Home Assistant tts_get_url -> the finished file at /media/<key>.
#   browser   The browser's own speechSynthesis. No file, device voices only
